{"records":[{"participants":["TX-1"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-message-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/message-export/message-77"}],"summary":"A message-export index references TX-1 and states that the export was collected on 2026-01-12; the source expressly cautions that collection time is not incident time. The index adds no participant and does not establish who controlled ACC-200.","timestamp_text":"2026-01-12"},{"participants":["Alice Chen","ACC-100","ACC-200"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-memo-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/memo/paragraph-2"},{"source_id":"a-support-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/provider-request/request-200"}],"summary":"The investigator memo repeats that Alice Chen is reported as the holder of ACC-100 and recommends obtaining provider-side account and authentication records. It states that the current packet is insufficient to verify ownership of destination account ACC-200. A provider-request log records an unanswered request for account-holder information associated with ACC-200, sent after transaction review began; no response, account-holder name, or controller identifier is present.","timestamp_text":null}]}